// ==========================
// LOCALHOST TESTING
// ==========================

### Get all contacts
GET http://localhost:8080/contacts

### Get contact by id (Pulls Marco)
GET http://localhost:8080/contacts/69f6dc383c5a74b69794e93a

### Create new contact (Adds Carlos Valderrama)
POST http://localhost:8080/contacts HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "firstName":"Carlos",
    "lastName":"Valderrama",
    "email":"elpibe@gmail.com",
    "favoriteColor":"Yellow",
    "birthday":"09/02/1961"
}

### PUT contact (Updates James Rodriguez's color to Red and modifies email)
PUT http://localhost:8080/contacts/6a0026c5e3bda593c9240078 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "firstName":"James",
    "lastName":"Rodriguez",
    "email":"james.updated10@gmail.com",
    "favoriteColor":"Red",
    "birthday":"07/12/1991"
}

### DELETE contact (Deletes Falcao)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/contacts/6a0026c5e3bda593c9240078 HTTP/1.1


